\dToko...\d%K%P
「都子…」%K%P
The two tickets I got yesterday at the cost of all the\nmoney I had left...%K%P
昨天（用我账户上几乎所有的资金）得到的， \n特里同酒店的圣诞晚宴双人券。%K%P
Regardless of whom I planned to ultimately invite, there\nwas one person I had to talk it out with first.%K%P
到底是邀请都子还是邀请麻实呢，\n 这事从一开始我不就已经确定无疑了嘛……%K%P
...The same person who'd likely end up sulking if all of\nthis was carried out behind her back.%K%P
…嘛，总而言之，\n在说不通的地方纠结的可能性很高。%K%P
