Yet despite my fears, Toko brushed the issue aside like it\nwas of little importance. I was still slightly taken aback\nby her unusual reaction.%K%P
…都子简单地拒绝了邀请，\n面对着这出乎意料的觉悟，\n我掩藏不住心里的疑惑。%K%P
...We had an odd relationship, now that I thought about\nit.%K%P
