I felt like she had been acting a bit strange lately.%K%P
最近，都子的样子稍微有点奇怪。%K%P
Unlike before, she would no longer sulk or get angry about\nme spending time with Asami.%K%P
哪怕是我和麻实两人独处的那时候，\n也没有看到都子这么不情愿的表情和态度。%K%P
Instead, she would regard us with an exasperated smile,\nseemingly implying that we were beyond help and that she\nwas an outsider to this whole business.%K%P
莫名浮现出惊讶的笑容，\n带着『哎，真是没办法呢那两人』这样的感情，\n远远地看着这边。%K%P
What kind of change of heart was that?\nAs her guardian, should I have been happy... or worried?%K%P
这到底是怎样的心理变化啊？\n作为监护人该高兴么？\n还是说，这是让人惊慌失措的紧急事态？%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
