%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
When did I become so presumptuous? I felt like I began to\ndisplay too much confidence as of late, especially when it\ncame to matters regarding Asami.%K%P
这么说来…\n我是从什么时候就变得这么傲慢了…\n面对麻实时竟会有莫名的自信啊。%K%P
I mean, why would a woman who had recently been proposed\nto spend the most important day of winter with the ex-\nhusband that she herself left?%K%P
再怎么说，那也是刚刚被其他男人求婚的女性，\n凭什么要在冬天最特殊的日子里，接受自己抛弃过的前夫邀请。\n真的有信心么？%K%P
Looking at the white bandages covering my leg wouldn't\nprovide me with an answer. Or rather, I felt as though\nthey were urging me to pose the question to my own heart.%K%P
看着覆盖在脚上那臃肿的白色石膏，\n觉得似乎不会得到那样的回答，\n却觉得『在我内心已经听到了回答』。 %K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dWell, that's that, then.\nI'm a bit busy right now, so...\d%K%P
「那，就这样吧。\n我现在很忙的」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAh! Wait a second!\d%K%P
「啊！\n等会！？」%K%P
As I continued to gaze at the ground, having lost myself\nin thought, Toko returned to her laundry duties as if to\nsay her business with me was finished.%K%P
我只是低下头思索一小会，\n都子就表现出明确的“没你事了”的态度，\n回头又去洗衣服了。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dLook, I can't give you advice on matters of love, okay?\nI've never had the opportunity to marry or divorce or even\nmake up with someone.\d%K%P
