「哎…总觉得怪怪的」%K%P
I knew I was being forceful.%K%P
我也明白自己很强硬。%K%P
Witnessing Toko slowly drift away gave me an indescribable\nfeeling of loneliness. I felt like a desperate parent\nunable to acknowledge that his child was growing up.%K%P
最近，总能感觉到都子一点点地长大独立，变得不再需要大人的照顾，\n对此我有些许寂寞，就像是离不开孩子的父母那样，\n只看得到别人的父母跟他们的孩子乐享天伦。%K%P
But what did it really matter? I had already decided that\nshe was and would be the most important person in my life,\nat least for a few more years.%K%P
但是，不管怎么样。\n我也决定要在从今往后的数年时间里，\n独占世界重要人物排行的第一位。%K%P
After all, if anyone could share that position with her in\nmy heart...%K%P
因为，当这个女孩排在第一位的时候…%K%P
...it would have to be someone of my own flesh and blood,\ncrying ceaselessly in my embrace; the source of an entire\nhost of worries.%K%P
一定会在我的怀里放声哭泣，让我为之苦恼，为之感动。\n因为那是有着我血脉的分身啊。%K%P
