%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dY... You...\d%K%P
「你、你这…」%K%P
I felt as though I had finally grasped the correct way to\ntreat her, or rather, I came to understand the pattern\nwhich her mind followed.%K%P
怎么说呢…\n我也是终于摸清了这丫头的脾气，\n明白了她的性格特征。%K%P
