Satisfied by the fact I had succeeded at distracting Toko\nfrom her chores long enough for her hands to completely\nstop moving, I was about to lean on my crutch and head\nback to my room...%K%P
于是，我一边对自己能让都子停下洗衣服的手感到无上满足，\n一边悠游自在地回到房间里…拄着拐杖。%K%P
When...%K%P
然后…%K%P
