%LC理
\d...A ring?\d%K%P
「………戒指？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dCan I get one...? You can buy me one... right, Osamu?\nI really want it!\d%K%P
「不可以么…？\n求你了，理君！\n都子一生的请求！」%K%P
Toko closed her eyes and clasped her hands together as if\nto beg. She then opened one of her eyes and stuck out her\ntongue.%K%P
然后，都子在我面前像是参拜一样的合十双手，闭起双眼。\n过了一小会，稍稍睁开一只眼睛，还吐了吐舌头。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...What?!\d%K%P
「………什么！？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dAhahaha! It's a promise.\nYou'll be getting Ms. Kouno the same thing.\d%K%P
「啊哈哈～！\n约好了，约好了哦？\n也要给老师一样的礼物哦～？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dW-Wait... anything but...!\d%K%P
「等、等会…只有这个需要考虑一下吧！？」%K%P
I-I'd been had...\nShe used my own plan against me!%K%P
被、被算计了…\n这个作战，被无可挑剔地利用了。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dWell, what are you gonna do now?\nIf you don't give it to Ms. Kouno, then I'm not taking it,\neither.\d%K%P
「那，你要怎么做呢？\n要是不给老师的话，\n我也肯定不会要的哦？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dW-Wait... that's...\d%K%P
「不，不是，这个…」%K%P
If I gave Asami a ring as a present...%K%P
我送麻实戒指…%K%P
I would have no excuse. There'd be no way I could laugh it\noff or make it seem like it didn't have any deeper\nmeaning.%K%P
要这样做的话，不管说什么话都没有用了…\n这可不是简单的事情啊。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI'll be looking forward to the 23rd, then.\nI wonder what kind of present I'll be getting...? Boy, I\ncan't wait.\d%K%P
「那就这样，好期待２３号啊。\n会收到什么样子的礼物呢～？\n真～是，好期待啊」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAha... ahah... ahaha...\d%K%P
「啊、啊哈、啊哈哈…」%K%P
It had been almost ten months since we met.%K%P
距离初次见面差不多已经１０个月了。%K%P
And almost half a year since I swore to be her guardian.%K%P
作为监护人，也已经过去了半年。%K%P
But... I had yet to win against this girl. In anything.%K%P
就我而言…\n还没有一次赢过这个丫头。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dEeeeeeeh?!\d%K%P
「诶诶诶诶！？」%K%P
...And this one kept overreacting to everything as well. I\nwas hoping she'd remember it was -me- who was inviting\nher, not someone actually significant.%K%P
…然后，这边就是永远不会变的，\n总是会一惊一乍的夸张反应。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAs I said, I accidentally ended up with two tickets to a\nChristmas dinner. Um, it was truly a strange\ncoincidence... at the lottery... at the station... you\nknow.\d%K%P
「就是说，一个偶然的机会，\n抽奖抽到了这个圣诞节晚宴的招待券。\n真的很偶然啊，在车站前面的抽奖活动」%K%P
That coincidence cost me thirty thousand yen, though.%K%P
也在偶然的情况下花掉了三万块…%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dTh-The 24th?! At six o'clock?\nTh-That's... Eh? Eh?! Isn't that, like, a holiday?!\d%K%P
「２…２４号？晚上６点？\n那，那是…额～！诶！\n那不是连休的小长假么！？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dThat's why I'm asking you...\d%K%P
「所以我这就是在邀请你啊…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dO-Osamu... Are you out of your mind?\nWhy would you go out of your way to woo your wife?\d%K%P
「理、理…你还清醒吧？\n跟你老婆说这个是想要干嘛…？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dUm, I thought we weren't married anymore.\d%K%P
「这不已经不是老婆了么」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dAh, right...\d%K%P
「啊，也是啊…」%K%P
Lately, it looked like Asami was starting to forget our\npositions.%K%P
最近，麻实老是会莫名其妙的忘记我们现在的处境。%K%P
Then again, that could be considered the inevitable\nconsequence of having lived under the same roof for over a\nmonth. And in the same room, no less.%K%P
嘛，这一个月来，不光是在一个屋檐下相处，\n每天都在这房间里一起消磨掉一天的时光，\n也照顾我，不论是洗澡还是换衣服。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dUm, I'm finally out of the cast, and I'll be able to\nreturn to work on the 25th, so...\d%K%P
「那个，石膏也终于取下来了，\n２５号之后就能再去上班了…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dR-Right...\d%K%P
「唔，嗯…」%K%P
For whatever reason, her face would cloud over every time\nI mentioned my recovery.%K%P
不知为何，最近当说到可以再去上班的时候，\n麻实的表情就瞬间变得暗淡下来。%K%P
Well, I might've just been overthinking it, just like I\ndid when I found Toko's smile somewhat unnatural.%K%P
不对，就像是都子『强装的笑脸』那个一样，\n有很大可能是我想多了。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dSo anyway, I was hoping to at least try and partially pay\nyou back for everything you've done for me.\d%K%P
「就是这样，至今为止你照顾我的这些，\n想要稍微报答你一下…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dBut... you're inviting me to this thing on the 24th of\nDecember?\nAren't you mistaking your priorities a little?\d%K%P
「也就是说…１２月２４号和我在一起？\n优先顺序没有搞错么？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAbout that... well, Toko already has plans for the 24th,\napparently. A Christmas party with friends, or so she\nsaid.\d%K%P
「那个啊，２４号都子像是有事。\n跟朋友一起开圣诞派对」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI-Is that so...?\nSo she was okay with this?\d%K%P
「这，这样么…？\n那，有好好跟她说过吧？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dYeah, she actually urged me to go with you.\d%K%P
「嗯，她说『好好跟老师去吧』」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dR-Really...?\nMitoko said that...?\d%K%P
「这，是这样…？\n那个美都子这样…？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dIndeed she did.\d%K%P
「那个都子，没错」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
At times, I couldn't help but wonder...%K%P
非常让人不可思议的事情发生了。%K%P
How did we -- the two adults -- ended up so influenced by\nthe whims of one little girl.%K%P
为什么我们两个人，\n都会在这时想到要照顾都子的情绪呢。%K%P
...%K%P
………%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\d...I realize this might be too much, but you're the only\nones that can help me. Please lend me some of your\nclothes!\d%K%P
「…就是这样，我知道自己很任性！\n但是，我只能拜托你们了！\n别的不说了，请借衣服给我！」%K%P
