%LC麻实
\dAh, not normal clothes, but something you could wear to a\nformal party. But nothing too flashy, if possible.\d%K%P
「啊，不是指平常的衣服…\n是去派对时候穿的正式衣服。\n啊，那个有点太华丽了，颜色也让我觉得驾驭不了」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dMy size is eleven... is what I'd like to say, but with\nclothes like that, I have too much leeway at my waist. But\nthen size seven is too small for everything other than my\nwaist...\d%K%P
「成衣的话尺寸是１１号…额，我也想这样说，\n可是１１号的话腰那太粗了，\n要穿７号的话别的地方又不够…」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
