「啊～公主，冷静点冷静点。\n你确实比较小啊。\n老师的有点大了」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dIt only comes off as bragging when you cows are saying\nit!\d%K%P
「你这安慰怎么让我听得这么不舒服！\n这对巨乳姐妹！」\n※译注：出自电视剧《巨乳姐妹》。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\d...So what do you think? I'd only need them for one day.\nAnd I'll make sure to send them to the cleaner's before\nreturning them.\d%K%P
