%LC麻实
\dNo way, it's nothing that serious. He just wants to thank\nme for looking after him these past few days... It's more\nlike a New Year's gift than anything.\d%K%P
「不是不是，不是什么特别的约会！\n只是对我照顾他的谢礼…你们想，也是要到年关了嘛」%K%P
