%LC麻实
\dHow could I?!\nWe're talking about spending my Christmas with Osamu!\d%K%P
「那怎么行！\n这可是和理一起过圣诞啊！？」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dAh... It's a Christmas dinner with a show, so I'm sure\neveryone participating will be dressed up, so...\d%K%P
「啊～…毕竟是圣诞晚餐秀嘛。\n你们想，周围的人也都有打扮是不是」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\d...I feel like putting him to work on the 24th now. I was\nobviously too lenient to let him laze off until the 25th.\d%K%P
「…我简直想让那家伙在２４号就上班。\n２５号才去上班的话太便宜他了」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dBetter suppress that feeling, princess. I mean, have you\never seen her back down when it came to Osamu?\d%K%P
「哎，还是控制一下。\n你见过这个人在跟理君有关系的事情上退让过？」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dI was aware of it to an extent, you know... I knew I\nacted out of line from time to time, and that it might\nhave upset some people.\d%K%P
「我啊，还是有足够的自知之明的…\n我自己有时候也会显出旁若无人的样子。\n也感觉有的人可能会因此而感到不爽吧」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\d...Wow, then it's actually pretty impressive how you\ncontinued acting the way you did despite understanding\nthat much.\d%K%P
「…你都有这种自知之明了，\n以前你那些满不在乎真是不得了啊」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dE-Even still! At least I tried reading the mood at times!\nI never ignored it when people said something straight to\nmy face!\d%K%P
「而、而且啊！？\n好歹也看一下周围的气氛好么！\n这样听不进去别人的话是…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI see... I suppose you're right. You can't just lend your\nclothes to another person that easily.\d%K%P
「也是哦。\n借别人的衣服，\n换谁都不会乐意吧」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dSee what I'm talking about?! She knows exactly what we're\ntalking about, yet keeps trying to deflect it like this on\npurpose!!\d%K%P
「是吧，就是这样的！\n因为知道我会回应什么话，\n所以故意这样说！」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dWell, that aside... I don't really own that many\nexpensive clothes. ...I'm pretty sure you've got more of\nthe kinda stuff she wants, princess.\d%K%P
「嘛，这个就先放一边…\n我手头上有的衣服不怎么多。\n…公主有不少吧？」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dUnfortunately, my dresses would be too flashy and\ncolorful for her... I follow the fashion trends of girls\nmy age.\d%K%P
「很不巧我的衣服不管是设计还是颜色都太亮了。\n…而且也是我这个年龄才能穿的衣服～」%K%P
