%LC夏夜
\dTeach...\d%K%P
「老师…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dAh, uh... um...\d%K%P
「啊，不是，那个…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dSo... could one of you lend me fifty thousand yen?\n...I'll return it as soon as I get my next salary, I\npromise.\d%K%P
「那我换个说法…\n能借给我五万块么？\n…这个月发工资了一定还上」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dUgaaaaaah!\d%K%P
「什么！」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dKyah?!\d%K%P
「呀！？」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dAh, gimme five seconds. I'll stop the princess as soon as\nmy brain actually registers what you've just said.\d%K%P
「啊～…稍微等５秒钟。\n让她整理一下大脑，就会停下来的」%K%P
...%K%P
………%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dHahh... Hahh... Hahhhhhh...\d%K%P
「哈～、哈～、哈啊啊啊啊～」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dHere, have some tea.\nIt's extremely hot, so make sure to drink it in one go.\d%K%P
「来喝点茶。\n很烫的，请一口气喝掉吧」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
