「你这不是想要让人冷静下来吧？」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dYep. I see you've cooled off enough to crack jokes, at\nleast.\d%K%P
「嗯，现在是彻底冷静下来了吧？」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\d...I'm just exasperated. I guess I can see how Osamu\nbecame the way he is now after having to live with this\nwoman for two years.\d%K%P
