%LC夏夜
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dIt will be some time before I get my insurance payout, so\nI don't have much left after paying the deposit and rent\nfrom my bonus.\d%K%P
