%LC夏夜
\dSo you already used up everything...\d%K%P
「全都用完，一点都没剩下吧…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dAh, I think I still have about fifty thousand yen extra\nif you subtract the necessary living expenses.\d%K%P
「啊，不是那样，好歹在必要的生活费之外，\n剩下了五万日元」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dShouldn't that be enough to figure something out?\d%K%P
「有这些钱的话，总能买下的吧？」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dAs long as you're not as extravagant as the princess.\d%K%P
「只要不像公主那样铺张就行了呢」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dU-Um, about that...\nI went to the boutique thinking the exact same thing,\nbut...\d%K%P
「啊，不，这个…\n确实是准备拿这笔钱去女装店买衣服…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dA more expensive piece caught your eye... right?\d%K%P
「还是说，喜欢更贵一些的衣服？」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dAh, I know that feeling. It kinda happened to me as well\nwhen I was looking for a new pair of pants for Osamu.\d%K%P
「啊～，有的有的。\n我去挑理君裤子的时候…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\d...Wait a second. When did that happen?\d%K%P
「…给我等等。\n你刚才说了什么？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dTo be honest... I could actually afford it.\nIt was exactly fifty thousand yen.\d%K%P
「那个的话…钱是够的。\n那衣服刚好就五万日元」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dThen what's the problem?\nDo you need two dresses or something?\d%K%P
「那不就没问题了？\n难道还要再买一条？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dUm... I think you'd be angry if I said any more.\d%K%P
「那个…是这个之外的问题。\n他肯定要对我生气了」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dDid you pick the wrong size?\d%K%P
「尺寸不合适了？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dThe size was perfect. I tried it on at the shop.\d%K%P
「尺寸刚好合适。\n…去试穿过的」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dDid you realize the design was not to your taste, after\nall? In any case, I'm sure you can still return it.\d%K%P
「那是不喜欢那个设计？\n不管是哪个问题，你换一件呗…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dNo... Actually, I like it very much.\nIt's black with laces, and just sexy enough...\d%K%P
「不是…非常中意。\n黑色的蕾丝，那个，感觉很好，也很性感，那个…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\d...?\d%K%P
「…？」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dUm, I'd like to ask something very basic, just in\ncase...\d%K%P
「那个，我想问一个根本性的问题…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\d...You sure you won't be angry?\d%K%P
「…没有生气么？」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dWhat did you spend that fifty thousand on?\nClothing, right?\d%K%P
「五万日元是要买什么？\n是衣服吧？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI suppose you could call them clothes... I lost\neverything in the fire, and only had three cheap pairs I\ngot at the department store for a thousand yen. I needed\nsomething better for the big day, so...\d%K%P
「要说衣服也是衣服吧…在火灾里面全都烧掉了，\n之后只买了三件一千块的，\n所以无论如何都想买…那天用的」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dCould you spit it out already? What kind of clothing is\nthat?\d%K%P
「不要这么遮遮掩掩的，直说呗。\n不是衣服么？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dIt was a piece of underwe-- kyah?!\d%K%P
「嗯，内衣…啊，疼！？」%K%P
%LCKaya & Himeo
%LC夏夜＆姬绪
\dAre you out of your mind?!\d%K%P
「你这没救的女人！」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...It's been ten minutes.\d%K%P
「…过去１０分钟了」%K%P
The clock above the station displayed the time as 11:10.%K%P
从站前的大时钟左右对称之后又过了５分钟，现在到了１１点１０分。%K%P
It was only ten minutes past the agreed-upon time, but I\ncouldn't help pulling out my phone and looking at the\nrecently edited entry that now said \dToko.\d%K%P
距离约定的时间只过了１０分钟，\n我已经开始焦灼不安了，\n一直盯着上个月要求我改口『都子』时路过的液晶屏幕。%K%P
There was a reason why her apparent late-coming filled me\nwith anxiety.%K%P
也有对她迟到的担心，害怕发生了什么。%K%P
For starters, during all the time we'd spend living\ntogether, I'd never seen her be late to an appointment.\nNot to mention her personality was the very antithesis of\nsuch behavior.%K%P
今天等的这个人会迟到，\n在我的记忆里是从来没有发生过的，而且从她的性格来看，\n这次更应该不会迟到才对。%K%P
December 23, Sunday.%K%P
１２月２３号，星期日。%K%P
I pretty much forced a holiday on her -- it was a parents'\nthanksgiving day, in a sense.%K%P
今天是我单方面决定下来的节日。\n名字也叫做『看护感谢日』。%K%P
Incidentally, tomorrow would also be a day of giving\nthanks -- I was neither celebrating the Emperor's birthday\nnor did I gave Christmas any preferential treatment... or\nso I thought.%K%P
顺带一提，明天也是『看护感谢日』。\n既不是天皇诞生日，也不是圣诞平安夜。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...Eleven minutes.\d%K%P
「…已经过去１１分钟了」%K%P
The Terrace House Hinosaka was roughly a fifteen-minute\nwalk from the station.%K%P
从Terrace House阳之坂到车站走路大概１５分钟。%K%P
I could still hear sounds from Toko's room when I left the\nhouse myself around ten.%K%P
我出门的时候是正好１０点，\n那个时候都子的房间里面还有动静。%K%P
\dIt wouldn't feel like a date if we didn't meet up in\ntown!\d%K%P
『因为是约会所以肯定得在外边等着吧？』%K%P
I was a fool to acquiesce to that.%K%P
那个只会唯唯诺诺言听计从的我还真是笨蛋啊…%K%P
If I knew I'd be glancing at the clock at least thirty or\nso times in the span of ten minutes, I would've insisted\nwe come together.%K%P
要是知道担心到１０分钟之内看３０回时间的程度，\n当时不管怎么样也要跟她一起出来。%K%P
If only we had done that, I wouldn't be worrying myself to\ndeath like this. If I spotted a car coming her way, I\ncould have thrown myself in front of it to save her...%K%P
要是那样做了，也不用在这里担心迟到的都子了，\n要是有暴走的汽车冲了过来，\n我也能挺身挡在都子前面…%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dNo, no, there's no way that could have happened!\nAlso, it's twelve minutes now!\d%K%P
「不对，肯定不会那样的！\n啊，已经过去１２分钟了！」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dThere's really no need to raise your voice like that...\d%K%P
「你也不用这么大声指责吧…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI mean, I can't help being worried!!\n...Hey, I didn't really wait that long.\d%K%P
「因为没办法我真的很担心啊！\n………啊，没有没有，我也刚到」%K%P
I was so flustered that I missed my chance to deflect it\nwith something better, like \dThat aside, you look striking\ntoday.\d%K%P
发音转换得太奇怪了，\n后面的『更重要的是，你今天也很可爱』就说不出来了…%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dSorry for coming a bit late.\nI spent too long trying to decide what to wear.\d%K%P
「对不起，稍微晚了点。\n因为不知道穿哪件衣服才好～」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dYou're telling fibs, aren't you?\d%K%P
「…说谎的吧？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dAhaha, you can tell?\nWell, I had a few errands to run.\d%K%P
「啊哈哈，看出来了？\n嘛，总之就是各种各样的事情～」%K%P
It didn't really seem like her getup was the result of\nmuch brainstorming. She was wearing the same clothes she\nalways did at the boarding house.%K%P
之所以没觉得她是真的在找衣服，\n是因为她就穿的和平常在公寓里一样。%K%P
It created quite a contrast with my own appearance: I came\nwearing my otherwise neglected non-work suit. It had been\na while since I put it on.%K%P
与久违地拿出了『并非工作时穿的唯一一件好西服』的我形成了鲜明的对比。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dHuh?\d%K%P
「咦？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWh-What is it?\d%K%P
「什、什么？」%K%P
Toko seemed to finally notice my outfit.%K%P
即使我装作无所谓，都子还是注意到了么…%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dDidn't you wear that when you came to the apartment for\nthe first time? Back when you were trying to propose to my\nmother.\d%K%P
「这是第一次来我家时穿的衣服吧？\n…要跟妈妈求婚那时」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAah?!\d%K%P
「啊！？」%K%P
She was right... I bought this suit specifically for that\noccasion...%K%P
这么说起来，我买这件衣服的理由，\n也确实只是为了那天的那件事…%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dHmm... mhm... oh-hoh...\nSo you picked that suit for our date...\d%K%P
「诶～，喔～、嗯～？\n跟我的约会，你穿这个…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dW-Wait... I think this is a misunderstanding...\d%K%P
「不，不，等一下…\n这里是有什么搞错了…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dWhat kind?\d%K%P
「什么错了？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dThe kind that concerns my memory and good taste in\ngeneral.\d%K%P
「…主要是我的记忆力啊感情啊」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI'm sorry. I completely forgot.\d%K%P
「抱歉。\n把这样的事完完全全忘记了」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...You really never change, huh. Particularly your lack\nof tact.\d%K%P
「…真是的，理君真是一点没变～。\n这种在最后关头的服软～」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI'm beyond ashamed.\d%K%P
「…丢脸了」%K%P
We were probably both remembering the exact same scene --\nour disastrous first meeting...%K%P
我们一定是想到了同一个场面。\n那个最糟糕的，我们初次见面的日子…%K%P
...as well as the rollercoaster of a relationship it led\nto.%K%P
然后，从那天开始的，\n一直到今天我们在一起相处的时光…%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dHaha.\d%K%P
「呵呵」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAhaha...\d%K%P
「啊哈哈…」%K%P
And so, we exchanged the same old smiles we always did,\nyet today, they felt a tad more special.%K%P
所以跟平常相同的两个人，\n互相交换了比平常更特别的笑脸。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWell then, how about we start by getting something to\neat? There's a good sushi restaurant on the top floor of\nthat building.\d%K%P
「好，去吃饭吧。\n这座大楼的最高层有一个很好吃的寿司屋」%K%P
I wouldn't ask what she wanted to eat today.%K%P
今天没有问『都子有什么想吃的么？』这种问题。%K%P
Because I knew that she'd be too worried about my wallet\nand end up choosing the cheapest place she could find.%K%P
因为如果这样做的话，都子肯定会暗自留心，\n说着『我喜欢这个地方』，找一家便宜的店。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dAh, but...\d%K%P
「啊，但是…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dIt's okay. I'll show you how I managed to conquer my fear\nof everything sushi-related, from rice through raw fish to\nsea urchins.\d%K%P
「没关系，醋饭，生鱼，贝类，鱼子，鲍鱼，海胆什么的都可以吃了。\n今天也让你好好看看我是怎么克服不能吃寿司的毛病的」%K%P
And if I did something that sounded like it was for my own\nsake, Toko -- being the paragon of frugality that she was\n-- would be unable to refuse merely on economic grounds...%K%P
而且事先准备好『为了我』这种理由的话，\n就算像都子这样极端有经济观念的人，也没法拒绝了吧…%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI brought lunch for us both, so let's eat it outside\nsomewhere.\d%K%P
「我做了便当，\n到外面吃吧」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...Excuse me?\d%K%P
「………什么？」%K%P
Or maybe she was.%K%P
看来不是啊。%K%P
...%K%P
………%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dHere you go, a big roasted chicken thigh! This is what\nmade me arrive late, so make sure to savor every last\nbite.\d%K%P
「快看，这么大的烧鸡！\n这就是迟到的原因，请享用吧～」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dThen we have a scrambled egg, kamaboko, some braised\nvegetables, black soybeans, and dried fish. Ah, and don't\nthink I was just practicing my New Year's dish\nrepertoire.\d%K%P
「然后是煎鸡蛋、鱼糕、黑豆小鱼、甘露煮虎鱼…\n啊～,这是为了正月的练习，你不要多想」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dIt's okay! Don't make that face! Look, I even brought\nsome champagne... though it's non-alcoholic.\d%K%P
「轻松点！别一副苦瓜脸！\n你看，我还有准备香槟！\n…不过因为各种原因买的是不含酒精的」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dWhat's wrong, Osamu?\nYou seem kind of down.\d%K%P
「怎么了理君？\n难得出来约会你怎么没精神？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...I'm cold, Toko.\d%K%P
「…好冷啊都子」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dIn that case, just suck it up and deal with it! You're a\nboy, aren't you?!\d%K%P
「这种程度的寒冷就用你的丹田之气抵御住！\n你是男孩子吧？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI think I'm a little too old to be called a \dboy\d,\nthough...\d%K%P
「不是，很明显“孩子”就不适合我了…」%K%P
Regardless of what she said, it was still the 23rd of\nDecember.%K%P
好像已经说过很多次了，今天是１２月２３号…%K%P
Hardly the season for sitting on the ground and having a\npicnic.%K%P
在公园吃塑料保鲜膜包着的午饭，\n这时间，这地点，这场景设定，都是我万万没想到的。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dFor starters, just bear with it until the toast.\nThere's some steaming hot tea waiting for you after that.\d%K%P
「总之，到干杯之前你就忍忍吧。\n之后就可以喝非常热的茶水了」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dThis scrambled egg wouldn't happen to be a takuan, and\nthis kamaboko a daikon?\d%K%P
「…莫非，说是煎鸡蛋其实是泽庵咸菜，\n说是鱼糕其实是萝卜？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dAhahahaha, then it would totally be like \dThe Cherry\nBlossom Viewing of the Row House Tenants\d!\d%K%P
「啊哈哈哈，这样才是完美的『排房赏花』的饭食～」%K%P
The rakugo play that Mr. Retired had shown me multiple\ntimes.%K%P
听过多少次的老爷子的拿手本领。%K%P
Though I didn't know what to make of Toko being able to\nfollow such an ancient joke.%K%P
这么精通古典落语，\n这真的是都子么…%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dYou didn't have to go out of your way to prepare lunch\ntoday.\nI was hoping to treat you to something new this time.\d%K%P
「其实也没有必要勉强做便当的。\n本来今天想请你吃好吃的…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dIt's a waste of money.\d%K%P
「不是太浪费了么」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dThat's not...\d%K%P
「这…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dNo, it is. I mean, we're family. Keeping track of your\nwallet is just as much for my sake as it is for yours.\d%K%P
「不不不，还是浪费。\n毕竟我们是父女吧？\n孩子给爸妈省钱，不也是为了自己么？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dToko...\d%K%P
「都子…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dYou're responsible for me, so you have to live a long\nlife without being too wasteful.\d%K%P
「因为现在你是我的父亲，\n所以一定要节俭持家，好好过日子，」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
That had been the plan since the beginning.%K%P
这是我一直追求的目标。%K%P
The two of us would look out for each other.%K%P
我守护着都子，都子被我守护着。%K%P
We'd be considerate of each other, scolding the other when\nnecessary and even have fights if they were unavoidable...\nbut never without making up in the end.%K%P
关系亲密，感情相合，\n有时候也会真的生气，去争吵，去怒吼，但又能马上和好。%K%P
I did my best to create that kind of familial ideal. It\nhad been my dream.%K%P
努力着有一天能构筑这种理想的『父女』关系，那就挺好的了…%K%P
...Or at least I thought I did.%K%P
我以为应该是这样的。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dHow's your leg?\nYou just got out of your cast, right?\d%K%P
「脚没事吧？\n刚取下石膏吧？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dY-Yeah, I'm fine.\nI still walk kind of weird, though.\d%K%P
「啊、啊啊…没事。\n就是走路还有点别扭」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dDo you wanna move to the bench?\nMight be more comfortable for your leg there.\d%K%P
「这样的话坐到长椅上吧？\n那样就不会给脚带来负担哦？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dNo, I'm fine here.\nLook, I can extend it like this and it doesn't hurt at\nall.\d%K%P
「不用，这里就好。\n你看，这样伸直了也一点都不痛」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...If I get sleepy, can I use it as my pillow?\d%K%P
「…那个，有点困，可以给我膝枕么？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dNo, you're going to die if you fall asleep here.\nSeriously, don't even think about it.\d%K%P
「不，在这里睡着的话肯定会死的。\n听好了？绝对不要睡着哦？」%K%P
As I said that, I felt the freezing, six degree chill seep\nthrough my clothes and into my bones.%K%P
这话刚从嘴里说出来，\n就感觉到了刚才在车站屏幕前看到的６度低温对身体造成的刺激。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dAhahahaha. Then I guess we should eat up and replenish\nour thermal energy.\d%K%P
「哈哈哈。\n那为了补充产热的能量，也要快点吃哦？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
